==Battleground==
*5 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pinky Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
**2 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Clyde Gory|Clyde Gories]] spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage. Stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] is your key to victory here. Bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to deal with the Red enemies.

